Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Kasha mpya: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault simba-fiche: message ufunguo: key.
>> decrypted := vault simbua-fiche: encrypted ufunguo: key.

Towe 
andika: ['Message:'], mstari-mpya
andika: message, mstari-mpya
andika: ['Decrypted:'], mstari-mpya
andika: decrypted, mstari-mpya.
